# riffle/

Root application for the Riffle predicate evaluation system. Implements a deterministic, auditable pipeline for processing items through typed contexts and sense-infer-act orchestration. The core layers compose pure state machines, predicate evaluation, and staged processing into a coherent system with typed I/O and no silent failures.

## Dirs

- `ctx/` -- Typed run context and state machine; the pure waist through which all transformations flow
- `predicate/` -- Predicate evaluation engine with caching, pipelines, loops, and DSL support
- `sia/` -- Sense-infer-act pattern layer; orchestrates staged runs with typed perturbations and emissions

## Files

- `application.ex` -- OTP application entry point; supervises predicate cache and manages lifecycle
